OL,3,GNEWSAAll flights cancelled due to
OL,4,A'persistent fog'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll flights on Thursday evening have
OL,7,Fbeen cancelled due to persistent fog.
OL,9,FGuernsey Airport said it was working
OL,10,Fwith the States of Guernsey, Guernsey
OL,11,FPorts, Visit Guernsey and airlines to
OL,12,Fsupport passengers, secure overnight
OL,13,Faccommodation for them and reschedule
OL,14,Fflights.
OL,16,FThe flight cancellations had coincided
OL,17,Fwith high numbers of visiting
OL,18,Ftravellers, which had placed
OL,19,Fsignificant pressure on available
OL,20,Faccommodation capacity, the team added.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
